			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 30, DX 9, IQ 1, HT 14, HP 40, WILL 10, PER 9, FP 16, SPEED 5.75, MOVE 5, DODGE 8, DR 6. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
